11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"偶题四首 其四","author":"胡应麟","text":"骆生去灵隐，八咏何人识。\n寥寥婺女傍，一片寒山石。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":18599,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋日同友人登兰阴山小憩华严精舍作","author":"胡应麟","text":"支筇上寒山，石磴连云陟。\n兰若无人声，禅关堕黄叶。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":18600,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄江云楼","author":"胡应麟","text":"危楼倚太空，袅袅一千尺。\n美人期未来，江云四面入。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":18601,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄松斋","author":"胡应麟","text":"箕踞长松下，一斋大如斗。\n白眼双飞扬，人间复何有。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":18602,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄雪廊","author":"胡应麟","text":"虚廊寂无人，饱看琼瑶堕。\n想像释迦文，颓然雪山坐。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":18603,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄江蓠馆","author":"胡应麟","text":"朝梦江蓠开，夜梦江蓠落。\n如何二十年，不到江蓠阁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":18604,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"出郭望西山诸寺二首 其一","author":"胡应麟","text":"柳色带平湖，桃花拂钓舻。\n斜阳下南垞，一片辋川图。","collec